<title>JAPAN: Japan May brass mill output rises 5.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan May brass mill output rises 5.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's brass mill output rose 5.3 percent in May from the same month a year ago to a seasonally adjusted 103,357 tonnes, according to preliminary data issued on Friday by the Japan Brass Makers Association.</p>
<p>The association released preliminary May data for output only. It also released final data for April, as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		 April 97	 yr/yr change    March 97</p>
<p> Output	 101,072	  +2.6 pct	  100,025</p>
<p> Shipments    104,146	  +3.9 pct	  106,958</p>
<p> Inventories   36,855	 -14.0 pct	   35,527</p>
<p>(NOTE: May shipments and inventory figures will be available later this month or by early next month, the association said.)</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
